IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgba-nouns`
IMPORT `sgba-vintage`
IMPORT `sgba-sched`

-- Broadcasting Act 1994 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition, informal consolidation in force from 25 September 2024.
-- LAYER 1, PART 8 (FOREIGN BROADCASTING SERVICES, ss 29 and 30) and PART 9 (DECLARED FOREIGN BROADCASTING SERVICES, s 31).
-- These rules state the 2024 consolidation.

§ `29. Orders proscribing unacceptable foreign broadcasting services`

-- src:1654 | 29.—(1) Subject to this section, the Minister may make an order
-- src:1655 | proscribing a foreign broadcasting service for the purposes of
-- src:1656 | section 30.
@ref s 29(1) (src:1654-1656)
GIVEN `the Minister has made an order proscribing the foreign broadcasting service for the purposes of section 30` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(1) the foreign broadcasting service is proscribed` MEANS
    `the Minister has made an order proscribing the foreign broadcasting service for the purposes of section 30`

-- src:1658 | (2) If the Authority considers that the quality or content of any
-- src:1659 | foreign broadcasting service which is brought to its attention is
-- src:1660 | unacceptable and that the service should be the subject of an order
-- src:1661 | under this section, the Authority must notify the Minister the details
-- src:1662 | of the service and the reasons why it considers an order under
-- src:1663 | subsection (1) should be made.
@ref s 29(2) (src:1658-1663)
GIVEN `the Authority considers the quality or content of the foreign broadcasting service unacceptable and that it should be the subject of an order` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(2) the Authority must notify the Minister of the details of the service and its reasons` MEANS
    `the Authority considers the quality or content of the foreign broadcasting service unacceptable and that it should be the subject of an order`

-- src:1665 | (3) The Authority must not consider a foreign broadcasting service
-- src:1666 | to be unacceptable for the purposes of subsection (2) unless the
-- src:1667 | Authority is satisfied that the content of that service included any
-- src:1668 | matter which prejudices the public interest or order, national harmony
-- src:1669 | or offends against good taste or decency.
@ref s 29(3) (src:1665-1669)
GIVEN `the Authority is satisfied that the content included matter which prejudices the public interest or order, national harmony or offends against good taste or decency` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(3) the Authority may consider the service unacceptable for the purposes of subsection (2)` MEANS
    `the Authority is satisfied that the content included matter which prejudices the public interest or order, national harmony or offends against good taste or decency`

-- src:1671 | (4) In this section and section 30, “foreign broadcasting service”
-- src:1672 | means a broadcasting service which transmits from a place outside
-- src:1673 | Singapore broadcasting services which are capable of being received
-- src:1674 | in Singapore.
@ref s 29(4) (src:1671-1674)
GIVEN `it is a broadcasting service which transmits from a place outside Singapore broadcasting services capable of being received in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(4) the service is a foreign broadcasting service` MEANS
    `it is a broadcasting service which transmits from a place outside Singapore broadcasting services capable of being received in Singapore`

§ `30. Offence of supporting proscribed foreign broadcasting services`

-- src:1678 | 30.—(1) This section applies to any foreign broadcasting service
-- src:1679 | which is proscribed for the purposes of this section by virtue of an
-- src:1680 | order made under section 29, and references in this section to a
-- src:1681 | proscribed service are references to any such service.
@ref s 30(1) (src:1678-1681)
GIVEN `the service is proscribed by an order under section 29` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 30(1) the service is a proscribed service` MEANS
    `the service is proscribed by an order under section 29`

-- src:1683 | (2) Any person who in Singapore does any of the following acts
-- src:1684 | shall be guilty of an offence:
-- src:1689 | (a) supplying any equipment or other goods for use in
-- src:1690 | connection with the operation of day-to-day running of a
-- src:1691 | proscribed service;
-- src:1693 | (b) supplying, or offering to supply, programmes to be
-- src:1694 | included in any broadcasting service transmitted as part
-- src:1695 | of a proscribed service;
-- src:1697 | (c) arranging for, or inviting, any other person to supply
-- src:1698 | programmes to be so included;
-- src:1700 | (d) advertising, by means of programmes transmitted as part of
-- src:1701 | a proscribed service, goods supplied by the person or
-- src:1702 | services provided by the person;
-- src:1704 | (e) publishing the times or other details of any programmes
-- src:1705 | which are to be transmitted as part of a proscribed service
-- src:1706 | or (otherwise than by publishing such details) publishing
-- src:1707 | advertising matter calculated to promote a proscribed
-- src:1708 | service, whether directly or indirectly;
-- src:1710 | (f) supplying, or offering to supply, any decoding equipment
-- src:1711 | which is designed or adapted to be used primarily for the
-- src:1712 | purpose of enabling the reception of programmes
-- src:1713 | transmitted as part of a proscribed service; and
-- src:1715 | (g) promoting, financially or otherwise, a proscribed service.
@ref s 30(2)(a) to (g) (src:1683-1715)
GIVEN `the person in Singapore supplies equipment or other goods for use in connection with the operation of day-to-day running of the proscribed service` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person in Singapore supplies, or offers to supply, programmes to be included in a broadcasting service transmitted as part of the proscribed service` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person in Singapore arranges for, or invites, another person to supply programmes to be so included` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person in Singapore advertises, by means of programmes transmitted as part of the proscribed service, goods supplied or services provided by the person` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person in Singapore publishes the times or other details of programmes to be transmitted as part of the proscribed service, or publishes advertising matter calculated to promote it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person in Singapore supplies, or offers to supply, decoding equipment designed or adapted primarily to enable reception of programmes transmitted as part of the proscribed service` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person in Singapore promotes, financially or otherwise, the proscribed service` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 30(2) the person is guilty of an offence` MEANS
    `the person in Singapore supplies equipment or other goods for use in connection with the operation of day-to-day running of the proscribed service`
    OR `the person in Singapore supplies, or offers to supply, programmes to be included in a broadcasting service transmitted as part of the proscribed service`
    OR `the person in Singapore arranges for, or invites, another person to supply programmes to be so included`
    OR `the person in Singapore advertises, by means of programmes transmitted as part of the proscribed service, goods supplied or services provided by the person`
    OR `the person in Singapore publishes the times or other details of programmes to be transmitted as part of the proscribed service, or publishes advertising matter calculated to promote it`
    OR `the person in Singapore supplies, or offers to supply, decoding equipment designed or adapted primarily to enable reception of programmes transmitted as part of the proscribed service`
    OR `the person in Singapore promotes, financially or otherwise, the proscribed service`

-- src:1717 | (3) Any person who is guilty of an offence under subsection (2)
-- src:1718 | shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding $40,000 or to
-- src:1719 | imprisonment for a term not exceeding 3 years or to both.
@ref s 30(3) (src:1717-1719)
GIVETH A Punishment
`s 30(3) the punishment on conviction` MEANS
    Punishment WITH `fine not exceeding` IS 40000
                  , `imprisonment` IS `imprisonment not exceeding` 36
                  , `daily fine` IS `no further daily fine is provided`
                  , `forfeiture` IS `no forfeiture is provided`

-- src:1721 | (4) Any equipment and goods used in the commission of an offence
-- src:1722 | under this section are liable to be forfeited to the Government.
@ref s 30(4) (src:1721-1722)
GIVEN `the equipment or goods were used in the commission of an offence under this section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 30(4) the equipment and goods are liable to be forfeited to the Government` MEANS
    IF `the equipment or goods were used in the commission of an offence under this section` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:1724 | (5) For the purposes of this section, a person exposing decoding
-- src:1725 | equipment for supply or having such equipment in the person’s
-- src:1726 | possession for supply is deemed to offer to supply it.
@ref s 30(5) (src:1724-1726)
GIVEN `the person exposes decoding equipment for supply, or has it in the person's possession for supply` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 30(5) the person is deemed to offer to supply the decoding equipment` MEANS
    IF `the person exposes decoding equipment for supply, or has it in the person's possession for supply` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

§ `31. Declared foreign broadcasting services`

-- src:1737 | 31.—(1) The Minister may, by order in the Gazette, declare any
-- src:1738 | foreign broadcasting service rebroadcast in Singapore on any relevant
-- src:1739 | licensable broadcasting service to be a foreign broadcasting service
-- src:1740 | engaging in the domestic politics of Singapore.
@ref s 31(1) (src:1737-1740)
GIVEN `the Minister has declared it by order in the Gazette to be a foreign broadcasting service engaging in the domestic politics of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(1) the foreign broadcasting service rebroadcast on a relevant licensable broadcasting service is a declared foreign broadcasting service` MEANS
    `the Minister has declared it by order in the Gazette to be a foreign broadcasting service engaging in the domestic politics of Singapore`

-- src:1742 | (2) A person must not, without the prior approval of the Minister,
-- src:1743 | include any declared foreign broadcasting service for rebroadcast in
-- src:1744 | Singapore on any relevant licensable broadcasting service.
@ref s 31(2) (src:1742-1744)
GIVEN `the person includes a declared foreign broadcasting service for rebroadcast in Singapore on a relevant licensable broadcasting service` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Minister has given prior approval` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(2) the person contravenes the subsection` MEANS
    `the person includes a declared foreign broadcasting service for rebroadcast in Singapore on a relevant licensable broadcasting service` AND (NOT `the Minister has given prior approval`)

-- src:1746 | (3) The Minister may —
-- src:1748 | (a) grant his or her approval under subsection (2) subject to
-- src:1749 | any conditions that he or she thinks fit;
-- src:1751 | (b) refuse to grant his or her approval; or
-- src:1753 | (c) revoke his or her approval at any time without giving any
-- src:1754 | reason.
@ref s 31(3) (src:1746-1754)
GIVEN `the Minister has granted approval subject to conditions, refused, or revoked it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(3) the Minister may grant approval subject to any conditions, refuse it, or revoke it at any time without giving a reason` MEANS
    `the Minister has granted approval subject to conditions, refused, or revoked it`

-- src:1756 | (4) Without limiting subsection (3), the Minister may, in imposing
-- src:1757 | conditions under that subsection, specify that —
-- src:1759 | (a) the number of persons capable of receiving any declared
-- src:1760 | foreign broadcasting service rebroadcast in Singapore on
-- src:1761 | any relevant licensable broadcasting service must be
-- src:1762 | restricted in any manner that the Minister may direct; and
-- src:1764 | (b) the rebroadcast of any declared foreign broadcasting
-- src:1765 | service on any relevant licensable broadcasting service in
-- src:1766 | Singapore must be suspended for any period that the
-- src:1767 | Minister may direct.
@ref s 31(4) (src:1756-1767)
GIVEN `the condition restricts the number of persons capable of receiving the declared service in any manner the Minister directs` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the condition suspends the rebroadcast for any period the Minister directs` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 31(4) the Minister may impose this condition` MEANS
    IF `the condition restricts the number of persons capable of receiving the declared service in any manner the Minister directs` OR `the condition suspends the rebroadcast for any period the Minister directs` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:1769 | (5) Any person who contravenes subsection (2) or fails to comply
-- src:1770 | with any condition imposed under subsection (3)(a) shall be guilty of
-- src:1771 | an offence and shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding
-- src:1772 | $100,000.
@ref s 31(5) (guilt) (src:1769-1772)
GIVEN `the person contravenes subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person fails to comply with a condition imposed under subsection (3)(a)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(5) the person is guilty of an offence` MEANS
    `the person contravenes subsection (2)` OR `the person fails to comply with a condition imposed under subsection (3)(a)`

-- src:1769 | (5) Any person who contravenes subsection (2) or fails to comply
-- src:1770 | with any condition imposed under subsection (3)(a) shall be guilty of
-- src:1771 | an offence and shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding
-- src:1772 | $100,000.
@ref s 31(5) (punishment) (src:1769-1772)
GIVETH A Punishment
`s 31(5) the punishment on conviction` MEANS
    Punishment WITH `fine not exceeding` IS 100000
                  , `imprisonment` IS `no imprisonment is provided`
                  , `daily fine` IS `no further daily fine is provided`
                  , `forfeiture` IS `no forfeiture is provided`

-- src:1777 | (6) In this section —
-- src:1779 | “foreign broadcasting service” means —
-- src:1781 | (a) any broadcasting service transmitting from a place
-- src:1782 | outside Singapore; or
-- src:1784 | (b) any broadcasting service transmitting from a place in
-- src:1785 | Singapore but which is owned, controlled or
-- src:1786 | managed by or on behalf of —
-- src:1788 | (i) the government of a country outside Singapore
-- src:1789 | or the agent of that government, whether
-- src:1790 | resident in Singapore or otherwise;
-- src:1792 | (ii) any company, association or society
-- src:1793 | incorporated or constituted under any law in
-- src:1794 | force outside Singapore, whether or not it has a
-- src:1795 | branch office or place of business in Singapore;
-- src:1796 | or
-- src:1798 | (iii) any person who is not a citizen of Singapore,
-- src:1799 | whether or not he or she is resident in
-- src:1800 | Singapore;
@ref s 31(6) "foreign broadcasting service" (src:1777-1800)
GIVEN `it transmits from a place outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it transmits from a place in Singapore but is owned, controlled or managed by or on behalf of the government of a country outside Singapore or its agent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it transmits from a place in Singapore but is owned, controlled or managed by or on behalf of a company, association or society incorporated or constituted under a law in force outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it transmits from a place in Singapore but is owned, controlled or managed by or on behalf of a person who is not a citizen of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(6) the broadcasting service is a foreign broadcasting service` MEANS
    `it transmits from a place outside Singapore`
    OR `it transmits from a place in Singapore but is owned, controlled or managed by or on behalf of the government of a country outside Singapore or its agent`
    OR `it transmits from a place in Singapore but is owned, controlled or managed by or on behalf of a company, association or society incorporated or constituted under a law in force outside Singapore`
    OR `it transmits from a place in Singapore but is owned, controlled or managed by or on behalf of a person who is not a citizen of Singapore`

-- src:1802 | “relevant licensable broadcasting service” means a licensable
-- src:1803 | broadcasting service specified in the first column of the
-- src:1804 | Third Schedule provided by a person specified in the second
-- src:1805 | column of that Schedule opposite the licensable broadcasting
-- src:1806 | service.
@ref s 31(6) "relevant licensable broadcasting service" (src:1802-1806)
-- The Third Schedule's first column and second column decide it.
GIVEN `it is a subscription nationwide television service` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider's name` IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(6) the licensable broadcasting service is a relevant licensable broadcasting service` MEANS
    `it is a subscription nationwide television service` AND `the person is named in the Third Schedule as a provider of a subscription nationwide television service` `the provider's name`
